timeline.body:
Minor, but I think we could write this as a switch and easier to read retry handling (probably opinionated):

```
CompilationActivityMode compilationActivityMode = getCompilationActivityMode();
if (compilationActivityMode != CompilationActivityMode.RUN_COMPILATION) {
   if ((stoppedCompilationTime != 0 && System.currentTimeMillis() - stoppedCompilationTime > optimizedCallTarget.getOptionValue(StoppedCompilationRetryDelay)) {
        compilationActivityMode = CompilationActivityMode.RUN_COMPILATION;
  }
}

switch (compilationActivityMode) {
 ...
  default : CompilerDirectives.shouldNotReachHere("invalid activity mode")
}

```

